Error [E0120]: `rows` was not moved here, so it cannot replace an owned value
  --> tests/ui/param_field_assignment_needs_copy_explicit.jet:6:21
    |
  6 |         self.rows = rows
    |                     ^^^^
 Why: this function has read access only and does not own the value
 Fix: copy it explicitly with `~rows`
